code="// DriverManager selects the registered driver matching the URL\nConnection con = DriverManager.getConnection(\"jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/college\", \"root\", \"root\");\nSystem.out.println(con.getMetaData().getDriverName());",
expectedOutput="MySQL Connector/J",
codeExplanation="The URL prefix jdbc:mysql tells DriverManager to use the MySQL Type 4 driver; metadata shows the driver in use.",
