["One ServletContext per web application per JVM.","<context-param> in web.xml for app-wide constants.","Attributes: setAttribute/getAttribute/removeAttribute shared across servlets.","Other methods: getRealPath, getContextPath, getResourceAsStream, log().","Attributes are not thread-safe without synchronisation.","Lifetime: until the application stops."],
