"Collaboration: RequestDispatcher forward (same request, URL same), include, sendRedirect (new request, URL changes).",
syntax="RequestDispatcher rd = request.getRequestDispatcher(\"/welcome\"); rd.forward(request, response);",
code="protected void doPost(HttpServletRequest rq, HttpServletResponse rs) throws ServletException, IOException {\n  String u = rq.getParameter(\"user\");\n  if (\"admin\".equals(u)) {\n    rq.setAttribute(\"msg\", \"Welcome \" + u);\n    rq.getRequestDispatcher(\"/welcome\").forward(rq, rs);\n  } else {\n    rs.sendRedirect(\"login.html\");\n  }\n}",
expectedOutput="admin → Welcome admin page; others → redirected to login.html",
codeExplanation="Forward keeps the request (with attribute msg) on the server; redirect asks the browser to request login.html.",
apis=["RequestDispatcher.forward/include","HttpServletResponse.sendRedirect","request.setAttribute"],
